  "historyNote": "#7938, eff 8-23-03; ss by #8336, eff 5-1-05, EXPIRED: 5-1-13 New. #10691, eff 10-9-14; ss by #13570, eff 4-25-23; ss by #14314, eff 9-9-25, EXPIRES: 9-9-35",
